    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Introduction:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on Texas Hold'em mechanics, players draw additional strategy cards with each action. By revealing the opponents' hole cards, they gain crucial information and pursue powerful hands by altering the suits or values of their cards. When holding a decisive advantage, they can raise the stakes to secure a thrilling victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > --Change the card values through skills<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037390/extras/2c5598c68d353dac00fca795bae062f8.avif?t=1738649573\" width=800 height=272 /></span><br>--Special hand in the game: Five Aces</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037390/extras/3bb8fc22ea150786fa5a9b9241eaceca.avif?t=1738649573\" data-has-big width=800 height=303 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story Introduction:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an endless desert, ten city clusters are scattered, each centered around a towering white pillar that supports a radiant sun, providing essential light and heat for human survival. As the strange tale of &quot;Hou Yi Shooting the Suns&quot; resurfaces, the sun in Qingcheng explodes! The world undergoes a dramatic transformation\u2014what is the truth? Accumulate strategies, uncover secrets, defeat opponents, and reveal the truth!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037390/extras/f0b51afb02a2db062217f108062c2610.avif?t=1738649573\" width=800 height=262 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roguelike Introduction:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sun above the city explodes, turning your city into ruins. You narrowly escape disaster, but the world has become a hellish place. You must continuously strengthen your abilities to survive in this malevolent environment... If you need any adjustments or further assistance, let me know!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Introduction:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on Texas Hold'em mechanics, players draw additional strategy cards with each action. By revealing the opponents' hole cards, they gain crucial information and pursue powerful hands by altering the suits or values of their cards. When holding a decisive advantage, they can raise the stakes to secure a thrilling victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > --Change the card values through skills<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037390/extras/2c5598c68d353dac00fca795bae062f8.avif?t=1738649573\" width=800 height=272 /></span><br>--Special hand in the game: Five Aces</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037390/extras/3bb8fc22ea150786fa5a9b9241eaceca.avif?t=1738649573\" data-has-big width=800 height=303 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story Introduction:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an endless desert, ten city clusters are scattered, each centered around a towering white pillar that supports a radiant sun, providing essential light and heat for human survival. As the strange tale of &quot;Hou Yi Shooting the Suns&quot; resurfaces, the sun in Qingcheng explodes! The world undergoes a dramatic transformation\u2014what is the truth? Accumulate strategies, uncover secrets, defeat opponents, and reveal the truth!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037390/extras/f0b51afb02a2db062217f108062c2610.avif?t=1738649573\" width=800 height=262 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roguelike Introduction:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sun above the city explodes, turning your city into ruins. You narrowly escape disaster, but the world has become a hellish place. You must continuously strengthen your abilities to survive in this malevolent environment... If you need any adjustments or further assistance, let me know!</p>",
    "short_description": "This PVE card strategy game is inspired by Texas Hold'em and features special skills that affect gameplay. With a story mode and a roguelike mode, each experience is unique. Enjoy thrilling battles where skill and luck intertwine as you embark on an exciting adventure!",
